<title>UK: Cho Hung Bank sets $200 mln 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Cho Hung Bank sets $200 mln 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHO HUNG BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	SPREAD     +23 BP    MATURITY   *22.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 6M LIBOR  PAY DATE    22.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AT PAR IN 1999</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX   DENOMS (K) 100 SALE LIMITS US/UK/S.KR/HK/JP/SG</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     STEPS UP AFTER THREE YEARS TO 35.5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
